<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>CSUCampusCraft 管理端</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
    <script defer src="/js/app.js"></script>
</head>
<body data-csucampuscraft-app="admin" data-authenticated="true">
<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">跳到主要内容</a>
<header class="site-header">
    <div class="container site-header-inner">
        <a class="site-brand" href="/" aria-label="CSUCampusCraft 首页">
            <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">CSU</span>
            <span>CSUCampusCraft 管理端</span>
        </a>
        <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="站点导航">
            <a href="/">首页</a>
            <span class="app-label">管理端</span>
            

            
            <span class="app-label" data-current-user>商城管理员</span>
            <form method="post" action="/logout" data-submit-state>
                <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="[REDACTED]">
                <button type="submit" class="button-secondary">退出</button>
            </form>
        </nav>
    </div>
</header>
<div class="container global-alerts" aria-label="全局提示区">
    
    
    

</div>
<main id="main-content" class="container main-content" tabindex="-1">
    <div>
    <header class="page-heading">
        <small class="eyebrow">校园文创商城 · 工程初始化</small>
        <h1>CSUCampusCraft 管理端</h1>
        <p class="muted">CSUCampusCraft 管理端工程已接入共享商品分类。当前展示数据库中的一级主题。</p>
    </header>
    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="themes-heading">
        <h2 id="themes-heading">校园主题</h2>
        <p class="muted" data-theme-count="5">
            共 <span>5</span> 个一级主题
        </p>
        
        <ul class="theme-list">
            <li data-theme-code="LANDMARK">校园地标</li>
            <li data-theme-code="COLLEGE">学院风采</li>
            <li data-theme-code="CLUB">社团活动</li>
            <li data-theme-code="SPORTS">校园运动</li>
            <li data-theme-code="GRADUATION">毕业纪念</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</div>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
        <span>CSUCampusCraft 校园文创商城</span>
        <span class="muted">课程实验 · 教学模拟</span>
    </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
